  },
  {
    "id": "v11h07",
    "sourceLanguage": "en",
    "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
    "source": "The quoted price is HK$ 8,245, but the customer account owner has not authorized any reduction.",
    "rubric": "報價角色及未授權降價",
    "mentions": []
  },
  {
    "id": "v11h08",
    "sourceLanguage": "zh-TW",
    "targetLanguage": "en",
    "source": "我們只能說可能十一月到貨，出貨日期還沒有確認。",
    "rubric": "到貨與出貨不同及可能性",
    "mentions": []
  },
  {
    "id": "v11h09",
    "sourceLanguage": "en",
    "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
    "source": "Please ask the buyer whether the samples have arrived; do not state that the buyer has accepted their quality.",
    "rubric": "到貨問句不等於品質接受",
    "mentions": []
  },
  {
    "id": "v11h10",
    "sourceLanguage": "zh-TW",
    "targetLanguage": "en",
    "source": "倉庫已簽收，不代表買方確認品質沒有問題。",
